{"id":"torrey:candlestick","source":"torrey","name":"Candlestick","slug":"candlestick","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"A part of household furniture — 2Ki 4:10.","refs":[["2Kgs",4,10,4,10]]},{"text":"Candles or torches. — Mt 5:15.","refs":[["Matt",5,15,5,15]]},{"text":"Lamps. — Ex 25:31,37; Zec 4:2.","refs":[["Exod",25,31,25,31],["Exod",25,37,25,37],["Zech",4,2,4,2]]},{"text":"Form, &c of. — Ex 25:31-36; 37:17-22.","refs":[["Exod",25,31,25,36],["Exod",37,17,37,22]]},{"text":"Held seven golden lamps. — Ex 25:37; 37:23.","refs":[["Exod",25,37,25,37],["Exod",37,23,37,23]]},{"text":"Had snuffers, &c of gold. — Ex 25:38; 37:23.","refs":[["Exod",25,38,25,38],["Exod",37,23,37,23]]},{"text":"Weighed a talent of gold. — Ex 25:39.","refs":[["Exod",25,39,25,39]]},{"text":"After a divine pattern. — Ex 25:40; Nu 8:4.","refs":[["Exod",25,40,25,40],["Num",8,4,8,4]]},{"text":"Called the lamp of God. — 1Sa 3:3.","refs":[["1Sam",3,3,3,3]]},{"text":"Called the pure candlestick. — Le 24:4.","refs":[["Lev",24,4,24,4]]},{"text":"Placed in the outer sanctuary over against the table. — Ex 40:24; Heb 9:2.","refs":[["Exod",40,24,40,24],["Heb",9,2,9,2]]},{"text":"Lighted with olive oil. — Ex 27:20; Le 24:2.","refs":[["Exod",27,20,27,20],["Lev",24,2,24,2]]},{"text":"Lighted &c by priests. — Ex 27:21; Le 24:3,4.","refs":[["Exod",27,21,27,21],["Lev",24,3,24,3],["Lev",24,4,24,4]]},{"text":"Directions for removing. — Nu 4:9,10.","refs":[["Num",4,9,4,9],["Num",4,10,4,10]]},{"text":"Christ. — Zec 4:2; Joh 8:12; Heb 9:2.","refs":[["Zech",4,2,4,2],["John",8,12,8,12],["Heb",9,2,9,2]]},{"text":"The church. — Re 1:13,20.","refs":[["Rev",1,13,1,13],["Rev",1,20,1,20]]},{"text":"Ministers. — Mt 5:14-16.","refs":[["Matt",5,14,5,16]]}],"refCount":31}
